“I like it,” Hat said. He was winning.
Charlene cupped her hands around her mouth and shouted, “Buttercup!
Buttercup! Come here, you ferocious beast!”
A few seconds later, the big Saint Bernard came lumbering toward us
from the side of the house. His bushy, white tail was wagging hard, making
