Esmerelda.
“I’m also in charge of all the scenery!” she boasted.
I wanted to say something mean and nasty, something to put Miss Highand-Mighty Tina Powell in her place in front of everybody. But I couldn’t think
of anything.
I’m not a mean, nasty person. And it’s hard to think of mean, nasty things to
