on the gray bricks.
“Looks good,” I told him. I had a sudden urge to slap him on the back and
make him smear black paint all over. But I decided that might not go over too
well.
I don’t know where these sudden urges come from.
“How’s it going?” Brian asked without looking up. He was filling in some
