I stared back at Zeke, thinking hard. I didn’t think it was a good idea. The
last time we sneaked into the auditorium, we ended up in major trouble.
I could see by Brian’s expression that he didn’t want to go, either.
But how could we say no to Zeke? He was practically begging us!
It was a warm night, but I felt chilled just the same. As we walked to school, I
