Way to go, Brian! I thought. He’s finally showing some spirit.
We lined up against the door and prepared to push.
I took another deep breath and held it. I was trying to calm myself down.
My arms and legs felt as if they were made of chewing gum.
This is just so scary, I realized. If we are locked in this tiny room and can’t
