The play. I’d almost forgotten about the play.
Zeke was right, I thought happily. He’ll get his part back now. Everything
will go fine.
The Phantom is gone.
Now we can all relax, I thought. Now we can enjoy ourselves and put on a
great performance.
Wow. Was I wrong!
