through the twisting fog, making it appear eerie and unreal.
I heard the clank of the trapdoor. I knew it was carrying Zeke in his
Phantom costume up from down below.
In seconds, the Phantom would make his big entrance, rising up in the blue
fog.
The audience will love it, I thought, watching the fog billow up over my
