“We want everyone who worked on the dance in the photo,” Mrs. Borden
declared.
She turned to the photographer behind his camera. “Okay, Mr. Chameleon,”
she called. “You can take the shot now!”
“Mr. who?” I cried. “No! Wait! Wait!”
